             "4b9fc044-f241-4874-89f3-a9c739dad16a"]}, Open]], 
        Cell["If retrying the region cell after running mass completion, \
first rerun MassTadpoles to restore the original ledger as the active input. \
That preserves the same region checkpoint key.", "Text", 
         ExpressionUUID -> "d12b352c-ad18-4169-ab6a-2bfdd5ca5a90"], 
        Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"rgzDiagnosticRun", 
